<title>USA: Computer Task Group awarded $3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Computer Task Group awarded $3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Task Group Inc, an information technology services firm, on Friday said it was awarded a three-year contract worth more than $3 million to provide applications maintenance to a family-owned frozen foods manufacturer.</p>
<p>The contract with privately held Rich Products Corp went into effect April 1.</p>
